# Endings: checked in this order on arrival day; the last one has no conditions.

card end_contact
type ending
when flag signal_contact
when res food >= 1
text First Contact, Sort Of. The fleet arrives with a recording nobody can explain and a crew that won't stop talking about it.

card end_followed
type ending
when flag echo_heard
text Company. Seven ships land; the asteroid parks itself in a high orbit and stays there.

card end_long_way
type ending
text The Long Way Round. Seven ships, one planet, and a log full of small kindnesses.
